==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
Star Peng is Single Target and has minimal support, so simply bring a few more expensive meatshields and some cheap attackers.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
This stage hardly has any difference compared the Chapter 1 version. Any strategy you used for Chapter 1 should work here as well.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
The Ribbo doesn't pose any major threat, so focus on the other enemies, specifically the Star Pengs. Bring [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Chill Cat]] and [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] for them. The rest comes down to the Ursamajor. Simply bring a few units that outrange him and finish him off with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]].

